      "start": 18474,
      "end": 20048,
      "from": "`\n.print-paper.batch .form-grid td{ text-align:center; }\n/* 낱말 한가운데서 자르지 않는다(「전해 연마 정 / 보」): 긴 번호는 .wrap 이 칸 안에서 접는다 */\n.print-paper.batch .form-grid th,\n.print-paper.batch .form-grid td{ word-break:keep-all; padding-top:1mm; padding-bottom:1mm; }\n.print-paper.batch .form-grid td.l{ text-align:left; }\n.print-paper.batch .form-grid td.r{ text-align:right; }\n.print-paper.batch .form-grid td.b{ font-weight:700; }\n.print-paper.batch .form-grid td.sec{ font-size:11pt; font-weight:700; }\n.print-paper.batch .form-grid td.sign{ height:11mm; }\n.print-paper.batch .form-grid th.inverse{\n  background:#000; color:#fff;\n  -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact; print-color-adjust:exact;\n}\n/* 반제품 Lot 의 접두 칸과 그 뒤 칸 사이는 점선: 한 값이 두 칸에 나뉘어 있다 */\n.print-paper.batch .form-grid td.pfx{ border-right-style:dotted; padding-left:1mm; padding-right:0.5mm; }\n.print-paper.batch .form-grid td.pfx + td{ border-left-style:dotted; padding-left:1mm; }\n.print-paper.batch .form-grid td.slash{ position:relative; padding:0; }\n.print-paper.batch .form-grid td.slash svg{ position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; }\n/* 원본 머리글의 공정 띠 (NC · PW · EP · QMN) */\n.print-paper.batch .flow-strip{ width:100%; table-layout:fixed; border-collapse:collapse; margin-bottom:2mm; }\n.print-paper.batch .flow-strip td{\n  border:0; border-top:0.2mm solid #888; border-bottom:0.2mm solid #888;\n  padding:0.6mm 2mm; font-size:8.5pt; color:#555; letter-spacing:0.04em;\n}\n.print-paper.batch .flow-strip td + td{ border-left:0.2mm dotted #888; }\n.print-paper.batch .flow-strip td.on{ color:#000; font-weight:700; }\n`",
